### List players (defaults: by fullName, offset 0, limit 25)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/players
Accept: application/json

### Page through the list
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/players?offset=0&limit=10
Accept: application/json

### Descending by name
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/players?sort=-fullName
Accept: application/json

### Women players (gender: men or women)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/players?gender=women
Accept: application/json

### Search by words of the name: any order, case and diacritics ignored
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/players?q=kaczmarek lukasz
Accept: application/json

### Players on one roster (take the id from GET /rosters)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/players?rosterId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Players of one season (take the id from GET /seasons)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/players?seasonId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Players of one league in any season (take the id from GET /leagues)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/players?leagueId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Setters of one season: the position is the one of the player's roster player in that season
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/players?seasonId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000&position=setter
Accept: application/json

### Position without a season or roster: the player's most recent position
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/players?position=libero
Accept: application/json

### Offset beyond the end: 200 with empty items, not an error
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/players?offset=10000
Accept: application/json

### Error: unknown gender (400)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/players?gender=other
Accept: application/json

### Error: unknown position (400)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/players?position=striker
Accept: application/json

### Error: unknown sort field (400, errors.sort)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/players?sort=heightCm
Accept: application/json

### Error: limit above the maximum of 100 (400, errors.limit)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/players?limit=1000
Accept: application/json
